{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLinkProps"},{"type":"text","value":" hook that takes an object as its argument and returns a "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>"},{"type":"text","value":" props object. These props can then be safely applied to an anchor element to create a link that can be used to navigate to the new location. This includes changes to the pathname, search params, hash, and location state."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"uselinkprops-options","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useLinkProps options"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type UseLinkPropsOptions = ActiveLinkOptions &\n  React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"link","href":"./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ActiveLinkOptions"}]}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLinkProps"},{"type":"text","value":" options are used to build a "},{"type":"link","href":"./LinkPropsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LinkProps"}]},{"type":"text","value":" object."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"It also extends the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>"},{"type":"text","value":" type, so that any additional props that are passed to the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useLinkProps"},{"type":"text","value":" hook will be merged with the "},{"type":"link","href":"./LinkPropsType.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"LinkProps"}]},{"type":"text","value":" object."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"uselinkprops-returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"useLinkProps returns"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>"},{"type":"text","value":" object that can be applied to an anchor element to create a link that can be used to navigate to the new location"}]}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"uselinkprops-options","text":"useLinkProps options","level":2},{"id":"uselinkprops-returns","text":"useLinkProps returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe `useLinkProps` hook that takes an object as its argument and returns a `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>` props object. These props can then be safely applied to an anchor element to create a link that can be used to navigate to the new location. This includes changes to the pathname, search params, hash, and location state.\n\n## useLinkProps options\n\n```tsx\ntype UseLinkPropsOptions = ActiveLinkOptions &\n  React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>\n```\n\n- [`ActiveLinkOptions`](./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md)\n- The `useLinkProps` options are used to build a [`LinkProps`](./LinkPropsType.md) object.\n- It also extends the `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>` type, so that any additional props that are passed to the `useLinkProps` hook will be merged with the [`LinkProps`](./LinkPropsType.md) object.\n\n## useLinkProps returns\n\n- A `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>` object that can be applied to an anchor element to create a link that can be used to navigate to the new location\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useLinkPropsHook\ntitle: useLinkProps hook\n---\n\nThe `useLinkProps` hook that takes an object as its argument and returns a `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>` props object. These props can then be safely applied to an anchor element to create a link that can be used to navigate to the new location. This includes changes to the pathname, search params, hash, and location state.\n\n## useLinkProps options\n\n```tsx\ntype UseLinkPropsOptions = ActiveLinkOptions &\n  React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>\n```\n\n- [`ActiveLinkOptions`](./ActiveLinkOptionsType.md)\n- The `useLinkProps` options are used to build a [`LinkProps`](./LinkPropsType.md) object.\n- It also extends the `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>` type, so that any additional props that are passed to the `useLinkProps` hook will be merged with the [`LinkProps`](./LinkPropsType.md) object.\n\n## useLinkProps returns\n\n- A `React.AnchorHTMLAttributes<HTMLAnchorElement>` object that can be applied to an anchor element to create a link that can be used to navigate to the new location\n"}
